        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"8e46e3e8-3419-45e7-a429-f880900b8167\",\"review_text\":\"Five star because I can listen any song I want even moz🇲🇿\"},{\"review_id\":\"91da85d8-e755-47cb-9a8a-054626f0daed\",\"review_text\":\"It's a very good experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"019f686a-b338-48a3-8afa-cc8dd28be599\",\"review_text\":\"music is good but dont like theres alot of ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"3bb1483a-500b-4af9-aed9-4e1a25d1af55\",\"review_text\":\"This is you are gaining Sweden 1.1 rating by burning our Quran our holy book the creation of Allah almighty you fools\"},{\"review_id\":\"fc046251-ee2d-42e8-9373-293027b86aaa\",\"review_text\":\"U cannot scroll the song in free version, It's like indirectly forcing you to join premium service\"},{\"review_id\":\"088b6f0c-109e-472d-8df9-8b61760a9bdf\",\"review_text\":\"Has made basic functions unavailable for free users\"},{\"review_id\":\"7027e541-2957-4d5a-abd6-7c387cc65e11\",\"review_text\":\"Ultimate Music Experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"1aefac5f-d392-4a1c-803a-03433b23fb10\",\"review_text\":\"Recent updates just removed all the necessary thing about the app and all requires premium now ..so I will delete this app if it doesn't change\"},{\"review_id\":\"78a0a09e-b203-43e7-88a6-0dfc2e8f3756\",\"review_text\":\"Scroll not working I have about 5 thousand songs, but when I want to listen alphabetically, I need to use my finger and scroll song by song, page by page to find a song that I want to listen. It always had on app, but lately it just vanished. We need that scroll button.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7c80c3a9-dd38-4341-84c3-70d8113b07a4\",\"review_text\":\"It's nice but I'd rather play on a baby game plus it takes so long to download and it's hard to figure out how to make it work\"},{\"review_id\":\"e0678a2d-0015-4a99-a0ba-ddc1c19274a4\",\"review_text\":\"গতহ🧥 ূাী@াূসরবশববববশবব। য়হানপগ,চৃহ,সশ\"},{\"review_id\":\"6c7df15a-d74f-4c16-8982-aaf6e0790670\",\"review_text\":\"The app seems to hold up well. The only annoyance is when my Android playlist shuffles automatically.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9d1ae352-a08d-4168-a2e0-0081e314a510\",\"review_text\":\"Add he aate hai bs vare vare bad 😔\"},{\"review_id\":\"35a2e17b-555c-4c69-9401-89d0bb55bf4c\",\"review_text\":\"Froud application\"},{\"review_id\":\"f2b48ccd-9c28-405f-9479-a8d9b79b6d77\",\"review_text\":\"Way awesome music podcast app\"},{\"review_id\":\"95a87d27-ba00-4708-8729-8632f20a1996\",\"review_text\":\"Great app. Am enjoying it, Godly and inspiring music\"},{\"review_id\":\"aa7de02f-9f14-4766-b136-6a03e754f1af\",\"review_text\":\"Nice and smooth 🤞♥️🔥\"},{\"review_id\":\"254fc496-616c-4eb1-907c-40668f3966af\",\"review_text\":\"Bhai kuch to baheter karlo\"},{\"review_id\":\"e038600c-fdd8-45da-8199-893b17b12a5f\",\"review_text\":\"I really enjoyed when I listen song on Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"362209c0-1689-4087-9937-a6a53bcfb557\",\"review_text\":\"Great choices and surgestions\"}]}"
